# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF regardless of the machine committing.
# Without this, git on Windows stores CRLF and every file touched on another machine shows
# as wholly rewritten. Migrations are the case that matters most: a diff nobody can read is
# a diff nobody reviews.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
